<title>UK: Blair welcomes Nationwide ballot result.</title>
<headline>Blair welcomes Nationwide ballot result.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Tony Blair on Wednesday welcomed the result of the ballot for the election of the board of the Nationwide Building Society, which resulted in the return of candidates committed to the mutuality principle.</p>
<p>&quot;I was delighted to see the result. I think the right decision was made,&quot; Blair told Parliament at Prime Minister's question time.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427767</p>
